      "content": {
        "columns": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "order": 0,
            "content": "<h1>About the bakery</h1><p>Juniper Street Bakery opened in 2014 as one oven and a folding table. We still bake everything on site, and we still sell out most days.</p><p>The menu is short on purpose. We would rather bake six things well than twenty things fast.</p>",
